# Test requests: start the API (F5), then click "Send request" above a request.
# Or use the test page https://localhost:7317/ (folder picker) or Swagger https://localhost:7317/swagger.
# OCR takes ~30-45 s per page, so the uploads can take a few minutes.

@host = https://localhost:7317

### Is it working? (API, OCR server and LLM server)
GET {{host}}/health

### Upload a grievance folder -> the observation
# Every file is sent as "files", named with its path inside the folder: <id>/ATR/..., <id>/Citizen/...
# The case ID is taken from the folder name. Change the paths after "<" to the real documents.
POST {{host}}/api/grievances/check
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=GrievanceBoundary

--GrievanceBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="448579/ATR/ATR.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\path\to\448579\ATR\ATR.pdf
--GrievanceBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="448579/Citizen/Citizen.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\path\to\448579\Citizen\Citizen.pdf
--GrievanceBoundary--

### Upload a single file -> its OCR text only
POST {{host}}/api/grievances/check
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=GrievanceBoundary

--GrievanceBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\path\to\document.pdf
--GrievanceBoundary--
